+++ b/debian/patches/rog-rtp-channel-layout-boundary-test.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,76 @@
+Description: Exercise Ubuntu RTP channel layout bounds with the actual helper
+Author: ROG HDR contributors <rog-hdr@invalid>
+Forwarded: not-needed
+Last-Update: 2026-11-20
+
